<section id="about" class="section-padding border-t border-hairline"><div class="container-editorial grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-6"><p class="mono-label mb-4">About / profile</p><h2 class="heading-lg">I like problems that sit between equations and interfaces.</h2><div class="mt-7 max-w-xl space-y-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-graphite"><p>I study Applied Mathematics and build software, spatial tools, AI experiments, and interfaces around systems that are easier to understand when you can see and interact with them.</p><p>This portfolio treats mathematics less like decoration and more like a design language: fields, routes, coordinates, topology, and structure.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8"><DisciplineGraph /></div></div></section>
